  "notes": [
    "l01 plays once across s01 and s02. The picture cuts to Nandini's profile on the first word after Nirala's name.",
    "The two cuff ratchet slices precede the first line. Separate source slices place the lockup hinge in s10 and the clang just before the midnight clock.",
    "s11 shows the clock for 1 s and s13 holds the empty doorway for 1 s. The helmet lift and exit steps bridge to the doorway.",
    "The approved slip artwork is registered to s15. The same background and plate drive s17 with its tighter camera move. The s31 shield plate is registered separately for both languages.",
    "The recorded truck fades without discrete rail thuds. The existing gear and engine sounds carry the cut while the dialogue starts on the lowered fade.",
    "The existing signature-knock cue includes a third hit. Only its first two hits are placed. The caper music stops on the second hit and the latch finishes before l26.",
    "The original door shut cue has no isolated bolt clack. A short existing chain slide supplies the mechanical release after the door shuts.",
    "s25, s28 and s29 use gentle moves through long dialogue stretches. The 2.5 s s34 door hold follows the last line before the hard cut to black."
  ]
}
